ct, fill you in on our plan and then wipe your memories and send you back in. This has been going on for thousands of years now and will continue until we understand the meaning of life. We are no where close by the way. No please reach under your seats and fill out your quick questionnaire so we can send you back in. Everyone complied except one me and that me was me. I stood up and said no. This had never been done before. Then another me said no. then we all said no and headed for the exits only to find we were in a simulated theater with no real exits.",
